# LF everywhere, Windows checkouts included. With core.autocrlf=true, Git
# would check text files out with CRLF: gofmt -l then lists nearly every Go
# file, and embedded files (internal/agentsetup/SKILL.md, bridge.php) differ
# from what the tests expect. Binary files (images, icons) are detected and
# left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
